# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=all
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# The loop starts at what its rows say comes round. In the typed copy `top` is an object, so the equality compares bits.
# CHECK: = ShapeTest v1
# CHECK: isInLoop=true isLoopHead=true:
# CHECK: = ShapeTest {{*}}layouts=[L0, L1]
# CHECK: = StrictEq {{*}}form=Bits
